cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Federated, privacy-preserving EEG classification of MDD on TDBRAIN: a leakage-safe benchmark"
authors:
  - family-names: Kotwani
    given-names: Kanan
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-11-25
repository-code: "https://github.com/kanankotwani28/eeg-detection"
abstract: >-
  A reproducible research benchmark comparing centralised, local-only, federated and federated +
  participant-level differentially private training of a spectral logistic-regression model and EEGNet
  for MDD classification on TDBRAIN, with a participant-level LiRA privacy audit and a one-time external
  test on the Mumtaz dataset. Not a diagnostic tool.
keywords: [EEG, depression, federated learning, differential privacy, membership inference, TDBRAIN]
